---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Passive Income System Review | ExpositionHub"
  description="A practical review of the Passive Income System training funnel and who it may fit."
>
  <main class="container">
    <article class="review-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Featured Review</p>
      <h1>Passive Income System Review</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        Passive Income System is a webinar-based training funnel designed to introduce
        a service-based online business model built around leveraged fulfillment.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>
          This offer uses a free training or webinar entry point rather than a direct
          checkout page. That can work better for readers who want context before
          deciding whether the business model is worth exploring.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="grid">
        <div class="panel">
          <h2>Pros</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Free entry point</li>
            <li>Clear beginner messaging</li>
            <li>Structured webinar funnel</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="panel">
          <h2>Cons</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Generic make-money-online positioning</li>
            <li>Better suited for warm audiences</li>
            <li>Needs pre-sell context to convert better</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Best use case</h2>
        <p>
          This funnel works best after a visitor has already read some context rather
          than as a raw affiliate link dropped into a post or message.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="cta-wrap">
        <a class="cta-button" href="/go/passive-income-system">
          Continue to the featured training
        </a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .review-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #334155;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .panel {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .cta-wrap {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
    background: #0f172a;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background: #1e293b;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>